=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Exoroche (S)} at {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} (K-9) for a cutscene that begins the quest.
** __(Optional)__ Speak to {p:Exoroche} in {z:Southern San d'Oria} (K-7).
** __(Optional)__ Speak to {n:Ailbeche} in {z:Northern San d'Oria} (J-9). You can ask about his father or grandfather, but only one at a time. You will need to zone if you want to ask him the other option.
* Speak to {n:Landeric} in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} (G-5).
** Zone into {z:Jugner Forest (S)} from {z:East Ronfaure (S)}, using the {p:Survival Guide} for the fastest route.
* Speak to {p:Exoroche (S)} at {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} (K-9) to receive a {@i:Bronze Sword|16535} {p:Bronze Sword}.
* Trade the Bronze Sword to {p:Exoroche (S)} (K-9) for a brief cutscene. He will return it to you.
* Trade the Bronze Sword to {n:Landeric} in {z:Jugner Forest (S)} (G-5) for a brief cutscene.
** You will be given multiple options. If you chose the wrong ones the sword will be returned to you.
** The proper answers seem to be:
*** "Ask about Exoroche."
*** "Not in the slightest!"
*** "The boy's spirit is true."
*** "Protect his family and kingdom."
* Speak to {p:Exoroche (S)} at {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} (K-9) to receive {@i:Trainee's Specs.|11499} {i:Trainee's Spectacles|Trainee's Specs.|11499}.
* If you speak to {p:Exoroche} in {z:Southern San d'Oria} (K-7) with the Trainee's Spectacles equipped, you will see a brief extra cutscene.

